      "message": "Hi Yunqing,\nIn `gop_length_decision_method \u003d 1`, a second TPL call is performed when sub-gop size could not be determined by the first TPL call. As per our experiments the BD-Rate loss without the second TPL call is negligible (~0.02%). Hence, this patch removes the second TPL evaluation in `gop_length_decision_method \u003d 1`.\n\nThis patch impacts the encoder output for speed 0 to 4. We ensured that the encoder’s output is bit exact for speed \u003e 4 and for `gop_length_decision_method` \u003d 0, 2 and 3.\n \nBD-Rate results are as follows:\n```\n                 Enc. Instruction                 BD-Rate Loss(%)\ncpu   Resolution   Reduction (%)    avg.psnr     ovr.psnr    ssim     vmaf   vmaf_neg\n 0       LOWRES2      0.297          0.0381     0.0271    0.0244    0.1130    0.0956\n 0       MIDRES2      0.306          0.0304     0.0439    0.0472   -0.0039    0.0242\n 0    SHORTS608P      0.361          0.0494     0.0451    0.0496    0.0969    0.0751\n 0   SHORTS1080P      0.252          0.0032     0.0000   -0.0092   -0.0156   -0.0106\n 0        HDRES2      0.349          0.0063     0.0044    0.0159    0.0200    0.0150\n 0       Average      0.312          0.0256     0.0240    0.0252    0.0420    0.0393\n\n 1       LOWRES2      0.637          0.0326     0.0252    0.0029    0.0679    0.0644\n 1       MIDRES2      0.736          0.0293     0.0324    0.0272    0.0043    0.0234\n 1    SHORTS608P      0.721          0.0439     0.0515    0.0564    0.0279    0.0296\n 1   SHORTS1080P      0.576          0.0201     0.0078    0.0109    0.0235    0.0197\n 1        HDRES2      0.748          0.0056     0.0067    0.0075    0.0061    0.0108\n 1       Average      0.681          0.0267     0.0251    0.0219    0.0259    0.0292\n\n 2       LOWRES2      0.320          0.0260     0.0367    0.0247    0.0581    0.0213\n 2       MIDRES2      0.351          0.0060     0.0103    0.0029   -0.0351   -0.0243\n 2    SHORTS608P      0.354          0.0200     0.0151   